        "reason": "Brief: reports the sensor over BLE and runs on one Li-ion cell. The C3 module has BLE, 4 MB flash for the reading history, and the 0.5 A supply it needs. Its USB pins also flash it over USB-C."
      },
      {
        "ref": "U2",
